section.t:
EP-MODEL-TO-MATTER-ACTION-v1 is a closed I-JSON
       object serialized with JCS
      . It binds model manifest, harness and safeguards;
      experiment protocol, material commitment and expected-effects digest;
      principal; executor and facility; purpose; destination; requested time;
      and max_executions=1. Raw biological content, prompts, completions, and
      hidden reasoning MUST NOT appear in the portable object.
